{"id":"6dc7a92cb0b555ce","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-graph-multigraph.md","title":"ZFC Graph Multigraph","display":"df-zfc-graph-multigraph — ZFC Graph Multigraph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-multigraph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-multigraph"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-multigraph — ZFC Graph Multigraph","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-multigraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-multigraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-multigraph — ZFC Graph Multigraph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,V,E,\\partial\\in\\mathsf V\">\\(G,V,E,\\partial\\in\\mathsf V\\)</span> (coded multigraph, vertex set, edge set, and incidence map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq\\mathsf V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq\\mathsf V^3\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMultigraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMultigraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V\">\\(\\mathsf V\\)</span> 表示集合论元宇宙；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是四元接口中的顶点集合参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}multigraph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphMultigraph}_S(G,V,E,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle V,E,\\partial\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,E,\\mathcal P(V))\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists x,y\\in V\\;(\\partial(e)=\\{x,y\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}multigraph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphMultigraph}_S(G,V,E,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle V,E,\\partial\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,E,\\mathcal P(V))\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists x,y\\in V\\;(\\partial(e)=\\{x,y\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq\\mathsf V^3$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,V,E,\\partial\\in\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq\\mathsf V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMultigraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}multigraph} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphMultigraph}_S(G,V,E,\\partial)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle V,E,\\partial\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial,E,\\mathcal P(V))\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists x,y\\in V\\;(\\partial(e)=\\{x,y\\})","display":true}],"bytes":1018,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-graph-multigraph.md|58-df-zfc-graph-multigraph]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}